    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d507">

                <pb facs="0574" n="524" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg524"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Caruth to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lisbon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-06-27"><hi rendition="#italic">June 27,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Portuguese Government entirely approves the suggestion that in case of need I
                    should act for Brazilian citizens here during the suspension of diplomatic
                    intercourse between the two countries.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caruth.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
